Third-party work this repository builds on
------------------------------------------

helius-labs/privacy-ring-examples
  https://github.com/helius-labs/privacy-ring-examples
  Pinned commit 9e5d69ade7e0c107a2929306d3b758a8969e1089.
  That repository carries no licence file and no licence field in its
  manifests. scripts/setup.sh clones it into .tools/ (not part of this
  repository) and builds its swap program, which the swap side of Keeler runs.
  These files in this repository are adapted from it:
    patches/swap.patch            a patch to swap/xark (program features, lock)
    lend/sdk/tests/utxo.rs        from test-utils/utxo.rs
    lend/sdk/tests/wallet.rs      from test-utils/wallet.rs
    lend/spike/tests/wallet.rs    from test-utils/wallet.rs
    lend/program/tests/mollusk.rs from test-utils/mollusk.rs
    lend/sdk/src/proof.rs         in part, from swap/xark/sdk/src/proof.rs
  Copyright in those parts remains with their authors (Helius Labs). They are
  not offered under this repository's licence.

